<div class="import-page">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-title-block">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">DATA IMPORT</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">数据导入</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">批量导入 IP 登记与网段数据 · 支持 Excel / CSV</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="import-layout">
    <div class="import-card">
      <h3>选择文件并导入</h3>
      <div class="import-zone">
        <form id="importForm" enctype="multipart/form-data">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>文件类型</label>
            <select id="importType">
              <option value="excel">Excel (.xlsx)</option>
              <option value="csv">CSV (.csv)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>重复 IP 处理策略</label>
            <select id="importStrategy">
              <option value="skip">跳过（保留原记录）</option>
              <option value="update">更新（覆盖原记录）</option>
              <option value="error">报错（不导入重复行）</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group form-checkbox">
            <label for="importAtomic">
              <input type="checkbox" id="importAtomic" checked>
              <span>严格模式（任何一行被跳过则整体回滚，不写入任何数据）</span>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>选择文件</label>
            <input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".xlsx,.csv" required>
          </div>
          <div class="import-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="btnImport">开始导入</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnDownloadTemplate">下载导入模板</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="import-result" id="importResult" style="display:none">
        <h3>导入结果</h3>
        <div id="importResultContent"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="import-help">
      <h4>列名映射参考</h4>
      <p>系统会自动识别以下列名（不区分大小写）：</p>
      <div class="mapping-grid">
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">VLAN</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>VLAN 字段</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">IP地址 / IP</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>IP 地址</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">MAC地址 / MAC</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>MAC 地址</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">设备类型</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>设备类型</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">设备名称</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>设备名称</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">物理部署位置</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>物理位置</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">所属部门 / 部门</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>部门</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">使用人</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>使用人</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">备注</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>备注</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">使用状态 / 状态</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>状态</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">向日葵远程ID</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>向日葵 ID</span></div>
        <div class="mapping-item"><span class="map-label">网关</span><span class="map-arrow">→</span><span>网关</span></div>
      </div>
      <h4 style="margin-top:18px">导入规则说明</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>IP地址</strong>为必填列，格式须为合法 IPv4</li>
        <li><strong>VLAN</strong>为空或「自动获取」时按 IP 前缀识别</li>
        <li><strong>使用状态</strong>为空时默认「已使用」</li>
        <li><strong>设备类型 / 部门 / 状态</strong>须在数据字典中已存在</li>
        <li><strong>可用池范围</strong>：主机号须落在 VLAN 规划的可用地址内</li>
        <li><strong>向日葵远程ID</strong>按纯文本处理，保留前导零</li>
        <li><strong>网关</strong>按 IP 前缀自动填充</li>
        <li><strong>重复策略</strong>：跳过 / 更新 / 报错 三选一</li>
        <li>结果最多展示前 20 条错误详情</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
